  "id": "positive-attitude",
  "term": "positive attitude",
  "definition": "In this packet, a positive attitude means maintaining a constructive outlook at work, especially by putting up with minor inconveniences and not complaining unnecessarily. It is described as part of sportsmanship, which supports a cooperative and supportive workplace.",
